"                    \u{1b}[38;5;204m\u{1b}[1m\u{1b}[4mrhit\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[38;5;204m\u{1b}[1m\u{1b}[4m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[38;5;204m\u{1b}[1m\u{1b}[4m2.0.4\u{1b}[0m

\u{1b}[38;5;204m\u{1b}[1mRhit\u{1b}[0m analyzes your nginx logs.

